leted pipeline runs of differing ages, the\n  console displays a report listing the completed runs older than the\n  configured age along with their retained artifacts, and the values\n  reconcile with Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata (passive-component\n  validation).\n- The age threshold for the stale pipeline-run report is configurable and the\n  report reflects changes to it.\n- An administrator can export either report as CSV, and the CSV contains the\n  same rows and columns as the on-screen report.\n- No code changes are required in the notebook controller or Kubeflow\n  Pipelines; both are consumed strictly as existing data sources.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P1): per-project idle-workbench report (last activity, owner,\n  reserved resources) sourced from notebook-controller activity tracking.\n- HLR-2 (P1): stale pipeline-run report (completed runs older than a\n  configurable age with retained artifacts) sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines\n  run metadata.\n- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of either report. Bundled because the\n  export renders the same report surfaces HLR-1 and HLR-2 build — it shares\n  their rows and columns and has no standalone surface, so it is not\n  separately schedulable as its own epic.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":29917,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-876e9c43fb8566ae","agent_id":"ac9f9af4db01e4d11","session_id":"270e0692-b5f6-41dc-9064-3e5481aa32f8","uuid":"6a6c5296-373b-4f03-b27e-7d6b6dafe832","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:21:14.947Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
